                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Amazing game with levels of environmental destruction that are still unmatched till this day. Genuinely solid game with a simple, but fun story, and great gameplay. Sandbox style environment with lots of freedom to do missions in the order you want, and an awesome collection of weapons and tools which can be used to topple and destroy everything that exists in the game. Highly recommended.",
